<title>USA: AmeriSteel Q2 profit slips.</title>
<headline>AmeriSteel Q2 profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Sept 30.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Net profit		$2,094   profit	$3,822</p>
<p> Revs		     158,086		  161,018</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net profit		$4,046     loss	   $39</p>
<p> Revs		    $327,908		  326,229</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 six month period included a $9.2 million charge for closure of Tampa rolling mill.</p>
<p>Ameristeel has publicly traded debt.</p>
</text>
